      <package fileName="CCDASTROWorkflowManager-1.1.46.zip" sha1="8af479e064d12413cc742f12ac394e4698b5f60e" type="script" releaseDate="20261013212245">
         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.46</title>
         <description>
            <p>Configurable PixInsight post-processing workflow manager.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>v1.1.46 restores SyQon Parallax, Prism and Starless through independently installed, user-selected external executables and local image files. No vendor scripts or models are loaded into PixInsight.</li>
               <li>Restores Seti Astro AutoDBE through a fixed, attributed engine included in the signed package under CC BY-NC 4.0 for noncommercial use.</li>
               <li>Restores tool choices and setup controls; documents external programs, file locations, licensing and network behavior in line with PTeam clarification.</li>
               <li>All 23 regression scripts passed. Native Parallax, Prism and AutoDBE synthetic-image checks passed; Float32 TIFF exchange and stars subtraction passed with a fixture. Interactive Starless inference remains a user test.</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
